They have `DeserializeXxx(JsonElement element)` methods. Since the code already has `property.Value` which is a `JsonElement`, I can use these directly:

```csharp
// Before: systemData = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<SystemData>(property.Value.GetRawText());
// After:  systemData = SystemData.DeserializeSystemData(property.Value);
```

And for serialization, the types implement `IJsonModel<T>` which has `Write(writer, options)`. But they also implement `IUtf8JsonSerializable` which has `Write(Utf8JsonWriter writer)`.

Let me verify the serialization pattern:

